    "How moves are rated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "评级是怎么算的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you move, Stockfish evaluates the position before and after your move, about %@ seconds each.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你走完一步后，Stockfish 会分别评估这步棋之前和之后的局面，每个局面约 %@ 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each evaluation is converted into your win chances (0 to 100 percent) using Lichess’s published formula.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个评估都会用 Lichess 公开的公式换算成你的胜率（0 到 100 之间）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rating depends on how far your win chances dropped: Inaccuracy from %lld points, Mistake from %lld, Blunder from %lld. Within %lld point of the best move counts as Best.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "评级看你的胜率下降了多少：下降 %1$lld 个百分点起算不够精确，%2$lld 起算失误，%3$lld 起算大漏着；和最佳着法相差不到 %4$lld 个百分点算最佳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lichess uses 5 / 10 / 15 points (10 / 20 / 30 on its −100…100 scale). These are a little more lenient, because the search is short and this app is for learners.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lichess 的标准是 5 / 10 / 15 个百分点（在它 −100…100 的胜算刻度上是 10 / 20 / 30）。这里稍微宽松一些，因为搜索时间短，也因为这个应用是给初学者用的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rating is always about your move, never the computer’s. Evaluations are estimates and can change with deeper search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "评级永远只针对你的这一步，不针对电脑。评估只是估计，搜得更深可能会有变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
